flowchart LR
    U[Student browser] --> UI[Custom Streamlit UI: app.py]
    UI --> P[Validated profile in session memory]
    C[Reviewed USA catalog: data/opportunities.json] --> V[Pydantic catalog validation]
    V --> W[Local rules and LangGraph matching]
    P --> W
    W --> AC[Shared agent contracts: agents.py]
    W --> RG[Bounded research: approved sources and optional clarification]
    RG --> SN[(SQLite official source snapshots)]
    SN --> W
    UI --> PL[Planning specialist on selection]
    PL --> AC
    AC --> FW[Configured model provider: Fireworks or Nebius]
    W -.-> KE[Keenable: broad subject search]
    UI -.-> KEF[Keenable: reviewed URL fetch]
    KE --> LE[Separate unverified leads]
    KEF --> ST[Source text for manual inspection]
    W --> UI
    PL --> UI
    UI --> DB[(Local SQLite: saved plans and stage metadata)]
    FW --> BL[(SQLite: cumulative usage ledger)]
    BL -.-> FW
    ENV[Ignored environment file: server-side keys] -.-> FW
    ENV -.-> KE
    ENV -.-> KEF
